    "message": "Remove unused imports and variables\n\nruff check --fix removed the unused imports and the unused `as exc`\nnames. The `walls` mapping in validate_route_geometry was never read;\nthe wall checks iterate geometry.walls directly, so it is removed by\nhand.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
