    },
    "message": "Fit the last long lines by hand\n\nThree one-line docstrings are wrapped without changing their words, a\ntrailing comment moves onto its own lines, and the JMA valid-date list\nis built in a local variable before the status is returned. The SQLite\nschema string keeps its one-statement-per-line layout under a noqa\ncomment, since splitting it would change the script text.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
