    },
    "message": "Skip the formatting commits in blame and keep lint at zero\n\n.git-blame-ignore-revs lists the three commits whose AST is unchanged:\nthe repository-wide ruff format, the import sort and the string split.\nThe removal of unused names and the hand-fitted lines are left out\nbecause they change code. docs/testing.md and CONTRIBUTING.md now state\nthat ruff check and ruff format --check pass, how to split long strings,\nand how to point git blame at the ignore file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
